 "lines": [
  {
   "id": "nar_m08_line_op_beside_001",
   "loc_key": "nar_m08_line_op_beside_001",
   "speaker_id": "spk_talar_venn",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m08_evt_operation_started",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "The survey teams keep reporting the same thing: ground that reads as two places at once, and movement beside them that matches no roster.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 177,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m08_vo_op_beside_001",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m08_line_op_offer_002",
   "loc_key": "nar_m08_line_op_offer_002",
   "speaker_id": "spk_neme",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m08_evt_operation_started",
   "delivery_channel": "cross_faction_radio",
   "source_text": "You are reading one page of a document that has two. I can hold the pages apart while you walk. This is an offer. It has been an offer for some time.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 189,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m08_vo_op_offer_002",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m08_line_op_terms_003",
   "loc_key": "nar_m08_line_op_terms_003",
   "speaker_id": "spk_talar_venn",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m08_evt_operation_started",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "We accept guidance, not custody. Our proxies walk the route; you tell us where the pages turn. Everything gets recorded.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 160,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m08_vo_op_terms_003",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m08_line_op_neme_004",
   "loc_key": "nar_m08_line_op_neme_004",
   "speaker_id": "spk_neme",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m08_evt_operation_started",
   "delivery_channel": "cross_faction_radio",
   "source_text": "Recorded. Yes. Record that the echo is not an attack. It is an address. Approach the first one and I will show you the difference.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 170,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m08_vo_op_neme_004",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m08_line_echo_001",
   "loc_key": "nar_m08_line_echo_001",
   "speaker_id": "spk_talar_venn",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m08_evt_first_echo_observed",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "First echo observed and logged. It repeats our proxy's approach four seconds ahead of the approach. I am filing that sentence exactly as written.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 185,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m08_vo_echo_001",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m08_line_echo_relay_002",
   "loc_key": "nar_m08_line_echo_relay_002",
   "speaker_id": "spk_neme",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m08_evt_first_echo_observed",
   "delivery_channel": "cross_faction_radio",
   "source_text": "Now the relay. The echo you saw is thin. The relay lets it carry weight without tearing. Build where I marked; the mark is load-bearing.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 176,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m08_vo_echo_relay_002",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m08_line_relay_001",
   "loc_key": "nar_m08_line_relay_001",
   "speaker_id": "spk_talar_venn",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m08_evt_relay_raised",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "Relay is up. The overlap reads steadier through it — both states now report on the same channel, politely taking turns.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 159,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m08_vo_relay_001",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m08_line_relay_guide_002",
   "loc_key": "nar_m08_line_relay_guide_002",
   "speaker_id": "spk_neme",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m08_evt_relay_raised",
   "delivery_channel": "cross_faction_radio",
   "source_text": "The paired states next. Send one witness into each. They will each see a valid ground. Both grounds are telling the truth. Walk them anyway.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 180,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m08_vo_relay_guide_002",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m08_line_states_001",
   "loc_key": "nar_m08_line_states_001",
   "speaker_id": "spk_talar_venn",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m08_evt_states_traversed",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "Both witnesses are through. Their traversal logs disagree on the terrain and agree on the distance. I have stopped expecting those to match.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 180,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m08_vo_states_001",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m08_line_states_converge_002",
   "loc_key": "nar_m08_line_states_converge_002",
   "speaker_id": "spk_neme",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m08_evt_states_traversed",
   "delivery_channel": "cross_faction_radio",
   "source_text": "The convergence accepts one visitor, and it should be the one who keeps the records. Come yourself, archivist. Bring the disagreement with you.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 183,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m08_vo_states_converge_002",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m08_line_complete_convergence_001",
   "loc_key": "nar_m08_line_complete_convergence_001",
   "speaker_id": "spk_talar_venn",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m08_evt_convergence_reached",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "I am at the convergence. Both states resolve here — the same ground, agreeing with itself again. Contact was reciprocal, repeatable, and is now on file.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 192,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m08_vo_complete_convergence_001",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m08_line_complete_bounds_002",
   "loc_key": "nar_m08_line_complete_bounds_002",
   "speaker_id": "spk_talar_venn",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m08_evt_convergence_reached",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "For the record: we made contact through the overlap. We did not learn who the Choir is, what it wants, or what it was denied. We learned it answers.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 188,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m08_vo_complete_bounds_002",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m08_line_complete_neme_003",
   "loc_key": "nar_m08_line_complete_neme_003",
   "speaker_id": "spk_neme",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m08_evt_convergence_reached",
   "delivery_channel": "cross_faction_radio",
   "source_text": "You walked both pages and wrote down both. That is more than most of the living have done for us. The address stands open.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 162,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m08_vo_complete_neme_003",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m08_line_fail_core_001",
   "loc_key": "nar_m08_line_fail_core_001",
   "speaker_id": "spk_talar_venn",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m08_evt_mission_failed",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "The command core is down. The overlap stays open, and unwalked.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 103,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m08_vo_fail_core_001",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m08_line_fail_talar_002",
   "loc_key": "nar_m08_line_fail_talar_002",
   "speaker_id": "spk_talar_venn",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m08_evt_mission_failed",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "I am cut off from the traversal. The convergence will not accept a record-keeper who is not there.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 138,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
   "subtitle": {
    "enabled": true,
    "timing_status": "unassigned"
   },
   "transcript_included": true,
   "voice_hook": {
    "id": "aud_m08_vo_fail_talar_002",
    "asset_status": "absent"
   },
   "binding_status": "authored_unbound"
  },
  {
   "id": "nar_m08_line_fail_witness_003",
   "loc_key": "nar_m08_line_fail_witness_003",
   "speaker_id": "spk_talar_venn",
   "trigger_id": "nar_m08_evt_mission_failed",
   "delivery_channel": "command_radio",
   "source_text": "We lost a state witness. Half a traversal is not a traversal; I will not log it as one.",
   "placeholders": {},
   "text_budget": {
    "max_characters": 127,
    "localization_expansion_percent": 30
   },
